                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "611d6025-499c-3705-b0d1-2aeadaf7a72a",
                "word": "dishy",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "5c377fb5-298a-47aa-a2dc-f36887c459f7",
                        "entry_id": "611d6025-499c-3705-b0d1-2aeadaf7a72a",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "dishies"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8de6442d-8d11-37ff-8737-1fa38cb71708",
                        "entry_id": "611d6025-499c-3705-b0d1-2aeadaf7a72a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A dishwasher (someone who washes dishes)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Australia",
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "18c18036-1978-4ffa-9174-ad40b136351d",
                                "sense_id": "8de6442d-8d11-37ff-8737-1fa38cb71708",
                                "text": "In hostels, everyone is expected to wash and dry his or her own dishes. If you make it known that you are willing to take over this chore in exchange for a small contribution, you may find lots of willing takers. Never underestimate the laziness of travellers. One night Roger Blake made $8 in ‘tips’ by doing this. He then asked the hostel owners whether he could set up as a ‘dishy’ for tips only."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "73c584a6-79f8-4cf6-b8f7-6733974b5b28",
                                "sense_id": "8de6442d-8d11-37ff-8737-1fa38cb71708",
                                "text": "I found a job washing dishes at Fish on Parkyn, one of the Sunshine Coast’s leading restaurants. […] When I got the job as a dishy at Fish on Parkyn I don’t think anyone there expected I would last long."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aafdfcc2-57c4-47f2-bff9-4f7453343380",
                                "sense_id": "8de6442d-8d11-37ff-8737-1fa38cb71708",
                                "text": "My years as a ‘dishy’ in a commercial kitchen showed me the importance of balancing an element of play while simultaneously managing time and tasks wisely."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7466aa7a-e28b-48ce-a8d0-d641038cc8e2",
                                "sense_id": "8de6442d-8d11-37ff-8737-1fa38cb71708",
                                "text": "He began as a dishy at a Whitianga restaurant, he worked at Omara's at nearby Matarangi, he did his formal training at Bay of Plenty Polytechnic, and travelled and cooked in Australia and the Pacific."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8e33b34-66e4-471c-9a0f-1a624dedbb78",
                                "sense_id": "8de6442d-8d11-37ff-8737-1fa38cb71708",
                                "text": "Jessica [Watson] volunteered and flew to Vanuatu to join the boat, paying for the airfare with funds saved from her job as a dishy."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "72ee04ba-cb1a-48eb-8d9c-8482ad369709",
                                "sense_id": "8de6442d-8d11-37ff-8737-1fa38cb71708",
                                "text": "Leah Blefari has seen it first hand, from working as a dishy and bakery attendant, to crewing for big hospitality companies Red Rock Leisure and Peter Rowland Catering."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a7bd96ef-237e-43f1-92fe-bf230dff5a0e",
                                "sense_id": "8de6442d-8d11-37ff-8737-1fa38cb71708",
                                "text": "“I started [to work] as a dishy and went from dishy to kitchen-hand and then I started working in a chicken factory as a cleaner,” he [Mitch Aldawsari] says."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d64ed030-9cf2-4ee5-8eef-48c6d6f2b837",
                                "sense_id": "8de6442d-8d11-37ff-8737-1fa38cb71708",
                                "text": "Nem refers to head chef Nemanja Babic, a Bosnian-born immigrant who came to Australia at age 19 and began his hospitality career as a ‘dishy’ at Courgette before rising through ranks to become sous chef."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea556206-8060-4b4f-89c6-188fa6908557",
                                "sense_id": "8de6442d-8d11-37ff-8737-1fa38cb71708",
                                "text": "In transitioning into these jobs, Jarrah started at the very bottom, as a dishy."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c93786dd-0f5f-4e8b-8219-72df309f67ba",
                                "sense_id": "8de6442d-8d11-37ff-8737-1fa38cb71708",
                                "text": "Will, now a man in his 30s, remembered working as a dishy at Pizza Hut as a teenager."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf19d135-de41-46e3-9bb2-86392994dd30",
                                "sense_id": "8de6442d-8d11-37ff-8737-1fa38cb71708",
                                "text": "The award-winning chef originally studied accounting but found a love for food after working as a \"dishy\" at Wollongong's Harbourfront to get through university."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea8c46a0-2498-4a7c-8a42-636fa4cb4dda",
                                "sense_id": "8de6442d-8d11-37ff-8737-1fa38cb71708",
                                "text": "“I started as a dishy, then went behind the bar, worked as a fryer and then they had staffing issues and I ended up running the kitchen.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
